{
  "_comment": "Copy to devices.json (gitignored -- per-install config, not synced with the projects). 'assignments' maps a project's manifest 'key' to a device_id -- omit a project, or set it to 'local', and it runs in the orchestrator's own process. Any other value must match the DEVICE_ID a backend_server.py on that device was started with. No LAN address is stored anywhere: RemotePeer finds a device_id's current IP live via the UDP discovery beacon (beacon.py) on every call, so a router restart or DHCP lease change never breaks this file.",
  "assignments": {
    "finance": "local",
    "recipes": "phone1"
  }
}
